7
00:00:18,547 --> 00:00:20,347
Jo is a nurse in the medical wing at

8
00:00:20,408 --> 00:00:21,507
Calder Air Station.

9
00:00:22,027 --> 00:00:24,048
Just after one, the guards carried in

10
00:00:24,169 --> 00:00:26,170
