11
00:00:26,629 --> 00:00:28,971
By 1.30, two had stopped breathing.

12
00:00:29,471 --> 00:00:30,550
Then they started moving.

13
00:00:31,032 --> 00:00:33,262
The doors sealed. phones inside were

14
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:36,064
collected. Before they took hers, Joe sent

15
00:00:36,084 --> 00:00:39,865
you four words, Northgate, come now, so

16
00:00:39,905 --> 00:00:42,506
you came. You crest the last hill, and

17
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:45,048
there it is, floodlights, concrete

18
00:00:45,088 --> 00:00:47,549
barriers, a fence, and in front of the

19
00:00:47,609 --> 00:00:51,051
Northgate, 200 cars, every one of them

20
00:00:51,131 --> 00:00:53,012
honking. The gate is closed.

21
00:00:53,573 --> 00:00:55,573
A loudspeaker on the guard tower repeats

22
00:00:55,793 --> 00:00:57,895
